{%- comment -%}
  How it stays shut: the 12-vial case closing and shut, side by side on the grey plate, with the facts.
  Images: fc-open-vert.webp (theme asset, Oct 11: the lid opening, magnets seated, vials in) and fc-seq-159.webp (shut, Content > Files).
  Shown once, on the home page. Other pages link here with /#shut.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="sec" id="shut" aria-labelledby="shutTitle"><div class="wrap shut">
  <div class="shut-copy">
    <h2 class="t-h2" id="shutTitle">How it stays shut</h2>
    <p>Magnets are built into the base and the lid. Lower the lid and they pull it closed, then keep it closed in a bag, a drawer or a car console. No clips to snap off, no friction fit to loosen.</p>
    <p>Every vial stands in its own well, cap up, so nothing knocks together. The magnets are silver in every color.</p>
    <p class="shown"><span class="dot" style="background:#0E100F" aria-hidden="true"></span>Shown: Black<span class="visually-hidden">, 12-Vial 3 ML Case</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="shut-pair">
    <figure>
      <span class="shut-plate"><img src="{{ 'fc-open-vert.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1440" height="1080" alt="The 12-vial case opening: the lid tipped up on its back edge with its magnets seated in it, the base magnets seated in their holes, and twelve vials standing in their wells" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>
      <figcaption><b>Closing</b><span>Lower the lid and the magnets take over</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <span class="shut-plate"><img src="{{ 'fc-seq-159.webp' | file_url }}&width=960" srcset="{{ 'fc-seq-159.webp' | file_url }}&width=640 640w, {{ 'fc-seq-159.webp' | file_url }}&width=960 960w, {{ 'fc-seq-159.webp' | file_url }}&width=1440 1440w" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 400px, (min-width: 500px) 50vw, 100vw" width="1440" height="1080" alt="The 12-vial case closed, lid pulled flat against the base" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>
      <figcaption><b>Shut</b><span>Held closed by the magnets</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</div></section>
